The XML scanner, the character decoders and the table of HTML character
names this library reads with are packages of go-fast-core (xmlscan,
charset, entity), by the same author under the same MIT License. Up to
v0.4.1 this library held copies of them (internal/xmlscan,
internal/charset, internal/entity); the provenance of their code and of
their data tables is in go-fast-core's NOTICE.

Written for this library:

profiles/*.json, profiles/*.md, testdata/profiles/
  The built-in profiles and their notes were written for this library
  from the public documentation of each schema (element and attribute
  names only); no schema, DTD or specification text is included.
  profiles/docbook.json is generated by profile_docbook_test.go from
  testdata/profiles/docbook/rules.json. The sample documents under
  testdata/profiles are synthetic, written for the tests; no corpus file
  is included in this repository.
